@startuml sequence-terminal
!include _style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "terminal provider" as T
participant "backend.ts" as B
participant "TerminalService" as S
participant "pty session" as P

T -> B : start(cols, rows)
B -> S : Start(ws, cols, rows)
S -> P : start shell from config in workspace root
S --> B : streamName
B --> T : stream connected
== Running ==
T -> P : keystrokes (stream, bytes)
P --> T : output, batched (stream, bytes)
T -> B : resize(cols, rows)
B -> S : Resize
== Exit ==
P --> B : event pty:exit

caption Fig. 2 – Sequence: terminal session
@enduml
